{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着高帶寬內存（HBM）技術向更高層數堆疊演進，散熱和良率問題正成為產業鏈面臨的新挑戰。最新消息顯示，三星電子和SK海力士計劃從2027年第二季度開始，大幅增加面向英偉達下一代AI加速器Rubin Ultra的8層HBM4內存供應，而非此前被廣泛看好的12層堆疊方案。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583930.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.100788+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:27:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_hash":"9ca48445c04adab64c7cedc159952abdff4ee41201c332e7a3cb47244349eeca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}